<title>SLOVENIA: ALPINE SKIING- MEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM FIRST-LEG TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING- MEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM FIRST-LEG TIMES.</headline>
